{"id":"n88464-2-5","stage":4,"title":"품위 · 品味","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88464-2-5-1","ko":"유민아, 이 옷 어떠니?","zh":"裕敏，你觉得这件衣服怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠니?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a932239414518dfd4fb6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88464-2-5-2","ko":"뭐랄까? 품위가 없고 좀 싸 보여요.","zh":"怎么说呢？它没什么档次，看起来还挺便宜的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐랄까?","meaning":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","explanation":"뭐：表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；랄까：라고 할까等的缩略，表示斟酌措辞：“该怎么说呢”。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"4","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"품위가","meaning":"品味，格调，品格","explanation":"품위：品味，格调，品格；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"품위","audio":"/audio/3017f311fd7de80f29dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88464","senseId":"2","lemma":"품위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없고","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"3017f311fd7de80f","term":"품위","zh":"品味，格调，品格","audio":"/audio/3017f311fd7de80f29dd.mp3","entryId":"88464","definition":"事物拥有的一种高尚而档次高的感觉。","pronunciation":["푸ː뮈"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/11d9007091557a7ab579.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.316,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88464","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.1427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么说呢？它没什么档次，看起来还挺便宜的。","裕敏，你觉得这件衣服怎么样？","那个人从刚才开始就一直在哭，到底为什么啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏，你觉得这件衣服怎么样？","那个人从刚才开始就一直在哭，到底为什么啊？","怎么说呢？它没什么档次，看起来还挺便宜的。"],"answer":2}]}
